message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "The Math of Aging: Humans and Dogs"
abstract: >-
  A verified mathematical description of aging in humans and dogs: mortality
  models fitted to life tables, mechanistic models, a review of intervention
  evidence, the mathematics of escape velocity, 19 theorems with proofs, and
  5 testable predictions. Produced with AI assistance; not peer reviewed.
  It does not contain or claim a cure for aging.
type: software
